.TH SCHED_GET_PRIORITY_MIN 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_get_priority_min \- returns the minimum priority for the specified scheduling policy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_get_priority_min(int policy);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the minimum priority for the specified scheduling policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_get_priority_min (2)
